gold_solution:
Label point $X$ as shown below, and let $Y$ be the foot of the perpendicular from $X$ to $AD$. [asy]

size(120);
pair A,B,C,D,E,F;
A = dir(0); B = dir(60); C = dir(120); D = dir(180); E = dir(240); F = dir(300); label("$10$",(A+B)/2,NE);
